<ContentPage
  title="Privacy Policy | FHA Properties Management"
  description="How FHA Properties Management handles information submitted through this website."
  eyebrow="Website information"
  heading="Privacy policy"
>
  <p><strong>Last updated: October 18, 2026</strong></p>
  <p>
    This policy explains the information this website receives when you browse
    listings or submit a property. It applies to the FHA Properties Management
    website and its related property submission and administration features.
  </p>

  <h2>Information you provide</h2>
  <p>
    A property submission may include a property description, location, price,
    photos, and the submitter’s name, phone number, and email address. The
    information is used to review and manage the listing and, if approved, to
    display relevant property details publicly. Do not include sensitive
    personal information in a listing.
  </p>

  <h2>How information is used</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To receive, review, and manage property listings.</li>
    <li>To publish approved listing details and contact information supplied for that purpose.</li>
    <li>To operate, secure, and maintain the website and its administration features.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Storage and service providers</h2>
  <p>
    Submitted information is stored in the application’s database. Property
    images may be stored and delivered by the configured image-hosting provider.
    Information may be processed by service providers only as needed to run
    these features.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and security</h2>
  <p>
    The administration area uses a secure session cookie to keep an authorised
    administrator signed in. Public visitors do not need an admin session.
    Reasonable technical measures are used to protect stored information, but no
    internet service can guarantee absolute security.
  </p>

  <h2>Your questions</h2>
  <p>
    For a privacy question or a request relating to information you submitted,
    email <a href="mailto:fehintolahayodeji@gmail.com">fehintolahayodeji@gmail.com</a>.
  </p>
</ContentPage>